  "prefLabel": "Man 205.01 Date of Issuance or Filing",
  "priorExpiration": "2004-07-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Man 205.01 Date of Issuance or Filing. All written documents governed by these rules shall be rebuttably presumed to have been issued on the date noted on the document and to have been filed with the board on the actual date of receipt by the board, as evidenced by a date stamp placed on the document by the board in the normal course of business.\n\nSource. #6162, eff 1-4-96, EXPIRED: 1-4-04\n\nNew. #8028, INTERIM, eff 1-17-04, EXPIRED: 7-15-04\n\nNew. #8286-A, eff 2-16-05",
